  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">I - New Partnership Initiative APS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(LAB - Global Development Lab):  The program is in Central Asia and Afghanistan to serves as an initial foray into reconnecting communities to demonstrate secure legal investment and ties can help localities begin to flourish.   With this demonstration, follow-on efforts could be programmed to nurture further broader cross-border development.  In the absence of a new funded initiative as this, with clear financial support from the US Government, it is not evident that border communities will spontaneously create these opportunities by themselves..</narrative>
  </description>
